                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> It's currently night, and the asterid can see the sky</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The asterid looks to the stars for guidance and rolls a d20. Until the start of their next turn, they can use the result of their roll in place of making a check or saving throw. The asterid can't use Knowledge from the Stars again for 1 hour.</p>"
